  "title": "Pineapple Upside-Down Pound Cake",
  "description": "This pineapple upside-down pound cake recipe is made in a fluted tube pan and filled with pineapple, cherries, cream cheese, plus white and brown sugar.",
  "authors": [
    "Elizabeth Thompson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:26:18-04:00",
